        ],
        "text": "The petitioner argues that the conduct set forth in the initial petition should be treated as the core operative facts for constitutional violations and that a relation\u2011back rule is superior to the Ninth Circuit\u2019s approach."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Blatt",
