            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Blatt, the respondent contends that habeas petitions must meet heightened pleading requirements, identifying all grounds and facts, and that the relevant conduct is the set of facts supporting the specific grounds for relief."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Blatt",
        "citations": [
