            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Blatt, the respondent also argues that the transaction or occurrence in the habeas context should be narrowly defined, focusing on police misconduct rather than counsel performance."
